{"id":646203012,"name":"SCP: Containment Breach","desc":"WARNING this game contains moderate flashing lights.\n\nSCPs have broken out of the Facility! Do what you must to survive, and you might just make it out of the Containment Breach! Play as a Class D, and escape! Play as a Guard, find a Researcher, and rescue them! Or Play as an SCP and cause extreme mayhem!\n\nJoin our server and group to interact with the community, suggest new features, report bugs, and get more updates!\n\n== Developers ==\nImFirstPlace, rote145, Shawn_VA, Reve_nue, TOASTERI0N\n\n == Changelog ==\n\nVersion 4.3.0 \n- Added New lobby\n- Added Flash Grenade item\n- Added Flashlight item\n- Revamped/Readded SCP-008 Outbreak game-mode\n- Added Beta-7 for SCP-008 Outbreak\n- Added new gun 'Kriss-Vector'\n- Readded AR-15 weapon\n- Readded USP pistol\n- Revamped SCP Selector\n- Revamped PVP room area\n- Revamped changelog GUI\n- Voting is now done on screen rather than touch pads\n\nOwned by pitchblacknova, originally created by MiniToon","path":"/game/646203012-scp-containment-breach","slug":"646203012-scp-containment-breach","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/7c424cc516fb43fe7f0876fb219c561990cf88066ed6921fdbd08b56c44d2e33.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-210c071be83b3e2ab6656324a84e889d/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":23668358,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-07-19T04:12:17.680Z","creator":{"name":"Containment Breach Community","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"totalPages":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"687b1b2102d759c1df951c4d","title":"Spam MTF spawn wave notification all players see it lmao","game":{"_id":"687b17ba02d759c1df94552d","gameId":646203012,"name":"SCP: Containment Breach","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"slug":"646203012-scp-containment-breach","path":"/game/646203012-scp-containment-breach","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.ko